Hi,

Please, do not use the rmc parameters to read an actigraph csv file. As stated in the GGIR documentation <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/GGIR.html#:~:text=GGIR%20works%20with%20the%20following%20accelerometer%20brands%20and%20formats:>, GGIR automatically handles the actigraph csv files, the read.myacc.csv functionality should be used for csv from other brands that are not automatically handled by GGIR.

Hope this helps.

Best,
Jairo

