Hi,

I encountered something weird while processing my accelerometer files. I use timewindow = c('MM') and data_masking_strategy = 2. I also use study_dates_file. No sleeplog (I attached the config file).

In the output of many files, GGIR detects a ‘wakeup’ before the midnight of the last night (example file summary report A). Also, for some files, the last day is seen as sleep completely (example file summary report B). When I change the data_masking_strategy to 1, this was solved (config file also attached).

However, this was not a problem in all files that I processed, some were fine with strategy = 2. And it is solved for me by using strategy 1, but there might be something wrong going on.

Best wishes,

Nina

